        <mxCell id="e_note" value="Cardinality&lt;br&gt;• A Room has zero or many Slots; each Slot belongs to exactly one Room.&lt;br&gt;• A Student has zero or many Bookings; each Booking is for exactly one Student.&lt;br&gt;• A Slot has zero to &amp;quot;seats&amp;quot; Bookings (booked ≤ seats); each Booking is for exactly one Slot.&lt;br&gt;• Student ⟷ Slot is many-to-many, resolved by Booking with a unique (student, slot) index." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="720" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
